	<category name="wcf.acp.option">
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr"><![CDATA[Shr1nkr]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.general"><![CDATA[General]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.redirect"><![CDATA[Redirect]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.target"><![CDATA[Destination URL]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.hash"><![CDATA[Hash Configuration]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.interaction"><![CDATA[Interaction]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.interaction.description"><![CDATA[Settings for reactions, share button, descriptions and other interaction features]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.design"><![CDATA[Appearance]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.design.description"><![CDATA[Settings for forward button, title icon, special effects and themes]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.advanced"><![CDATA[Advanced]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.category.shrinkr.advanced.description"><![CDATA[Advanced settings for experts. <strong>Warning:</strong> Incorrect configurations can cause the URL shortener to stop working.]]></item>

		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_active"><![CDATA[Activate the Shr1nkr]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_active.description"><![CDATA[Activates the Shr1nkr. After activation, you can create and manage short URLs.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_counter_active"><![CDATA[Activate the visit counter for short URLs]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_counter_active.description"><![CDATA[Shows how many times a short URL has been accessed. The counter is displayed in the <a href="{link application='shrinkr' controller='UrlList'}{/link}">URL list</a> and can be reset if needed.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_forwarding_must_confirmed"><![CDATA[Forwarding must be confirmed]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_forwarding_must_confirmed.description"><![CDATA[On the redirect page, a button must first be clicked before redirecting to the target URL. This increases security and prevents automatic redirects. If "Delayed forwarding" is activated, the button can only be pressed after the waiting time has elapsed.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_time_until_forwarding"><![CDATA[Delayed forwarding (in seconds)]]></item>
        <item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_time_until_forwarding.description"><![CDATA[Displays a redirect page for the specified number of seconds before automatically redirecting to the target URL. Example: With "5", it waits 5 seconds. Set "0" for immediate redirect.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_expertmode_active"><![CDATA[Activate the expert mode]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_expertmode_active.description"><![CDATA[<strong>Caution:</strong> This setting should only be activated by experienced administrators. In expert mode, advanced options are unlocked that are not needed in most cases. Incorrect configurations can cause the Shr1nkr to stop working.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_normal_page_mode"><![CDATA[Shows more elements on the redirect page]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_normal_page_mode.description"><![CDATA[On the redirect page, header, footer and all boxes are additionally displayed. By default, only a minimal redirect page without header/footer is shown.]]></item>

		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_hash_length"><![CDATA[Hash length]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_hash_length.description"><![CDATA[Determines the length of the random hash code for short URLs. The longer the hash, the more different URLs are possible. Example: With a hash length of 4 characters, there are 1,679,616 different possibilities (36^4). Recommended: 4-8 characters.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_hash_prefix"><![CDATA[Hash prefix]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_hash_prefix.description"><![CDATA[An optional text that is inserted before each hash code. Example: With prefix "link-" and hash "abc", the URL <kbd>/r/link-abc/</kbd> is generated. <strong>Important:</strong> The total length (prefix + hash) must not exceed 64 characters.]]></item>
		
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_only_https"><![CDATA[Allow HTTPS destination URLs only (https://)]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_only_https.description"><![CDATA[Only allows target URLs that start with <kbd>https://</kbd>. URLs with <kbd>http://</kbd> are rejected. This increases security by using encrypted connections.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_deactivate_forwarding_chains"><![CDATA[Deactivate redirect chains]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_deactivate_forwarding_chains.description"><![CDATA[Prevents target URLs that themselves redirect to other URLs (redirect chains). Example: URL A redirects to URL B, which in turn redirects to URL C. Such chains are blocked by default as they can cause problems.]]></item>
		
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_pattern"><![CDATA[Hash RegEx pattern]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_pattern.description"><![CDATA[Allows you to define a custom pattern (RegEx pattern) for hash codes. Default: <kbd>[0-9a-z\-]{1,64}</kbd> (numbers, lowercase letters and hyphens, 1-64 characters). <strong>Experts only:</strong> Incorrect patterns can prevent URLs from being created.]]></item>

		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_external_url"><![CDATA[External URL]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_external_url.description"><![CDATA[Overwrites the base URL for all generated short URLs. Example: With <kbd>https://short.example.com</kbd>, URLs like <kbd>https://short.example.com/r/test/</kbd> are generated instead of <kbd>https://example.com/urls/r/test/</kbd>. <strong>Requires:</strong> Additional web server configuration (e.g. subdomain redirect). This option is only available in <a href="{link controller='Option'}#category_shrinkr.expertmode{/link}">Expert Mode</a>.]]></item>
		
		<!-- Featured Links Options -->
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_install_demo_data"><![CDATA[Install demo data]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_install_demo_data.description"><![CDATA[Installs demo URLs (DEMO-1 to DEMO-7) with example discounts, specials, featured links and custom buttons for testing purposes.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_remove_shrinkr_prefix"><![CDATA[Remove /shrinkr/ prefix from URLs]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_remove_shrinkr_prefix.description"><![CDATA[Removes the <kbd>/shrinkr/</kbd> prefix from generated short URLs. Instead of <kbd>/shrinkr/r/test/</kbd>, <kbd>/r/test/</kbd> will be generated. Requires manual webserver configuration. <strong>Important:</strong> Link rewriting must be enabled under "General".]]></item>
		
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_reactions"><![CDATA[Enable reactions]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_reactions.description"><![CDATA[Enables the reaction system for short URLs on the redirect page.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_guest_reactions"><![CDATA[Enable guest reactions]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_guest_reactions.description"><![CDATA[Allows guests to react on short URLs. Guest reactions are stored and synchronized with the user account upon registration.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_share_button"><![CDATA[Enable share button]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_share_button.description"><![CDATA[Shows the share button on the redirect page.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_descriptions"><![CDATA[Enable descriptions]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_descriptions.description"><![CDATA[Enables the display of descriptions on the redirect page. This setting overrides the individual activation/deactivation of single descriptions.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_custom_forward_button"><![CDATA[Enable 3D button style]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_custom_forward_button.label"><![CDATA[Override forward button]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_custom_forward_button.description"><![CDATA[The button automatically adapts to the promo badge colors.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_custom_forward_button.preview"><![CDATA[Preview:]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_title_icon"><![CDATA[Title Icon]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_title_icon.description"><![CDATA[Select a Font Awesome icon to display before the h1 title on the redirect page.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_theme_effects"><![CDATA[Enable special effects]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_theme_effects.description"><![CDATA[Allows theme-specific effects such as autumn leaves, snow or ghosts.]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_qr_code"><![CDATA[Enable QR code generation]]></item>
		<item name="wcf.acp.option.shrinkr_enable_qr_code.description"><![CDATA[Enables the generation and display of QR codes in the URL list in the ACP.]]></item>
	</category>

