		<item name="shrinkr.acp.url.removeShrinkrPrefix.info.htaccess.generate"><![CDATA[Generate Rewrite Rules]]></item>
		<item name="shrinkr.acp.url.removeShrinkrPrefix.info.htaccess.generate.description"><![CDATA[Click the "Generate Rewrite Rules" button in the top right to display the required rules for Apache (.htaccess) and nginx (nginx.conf) and insert them into your web server configuration.]]></item>
		<item name="shrinkr.acp.url.rewrite.nginx.instructions"><![CDATA[These rules must be inserted into the server block of your nginx.conf]]></item>
		<item name="shrinkr.acp.url.rewrite.nginx.important"><![CDATA[IMPORTANT: The /r/ rule must be placed BEFORE the standard WoltLab rules!]]></item>
